rator prerequisites." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n3"><mxGeometry x="1330.00" y="640.00" width="1040.00" height="145.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No created resources; load balancer and admin secret flags are false and ADB ID is null.&lt;br&gt;This blueprint adds ingress and secret support to an existing ADB. It does not create ADW/ATP, APEX workspace, users or application deployment.&lt;br&gt;Listener, backend set, backends and secret are explicitly enumerated in resource-detail pages. No health probe, TLS session or APEX login was tested." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1150.00" width="2460.00" height="135.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" value="Source review: 2026-10-28. No cloud provisioning, provider revalidation, compliance certification, packet test or recovery drill.&lt;br&gt;Placement values are source defaults or marked operator inputs. Arrows are configuration relationships / stated route intent, not verified runtime behavior." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1320.00" width="2460.00" height="65.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="Configured backend / 443" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=